o, total **loss** = $5 (first race) + $16.5 (third race) = **$21.5**\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Average loss per race\n\nThere were **3 races**, so the **average loss per race** is:\n\n$$\n\\text{Average loss} = \\frac{\\text{Total loss}}{\\text{Number of races}} = \\frac{21.5}{3} \\approx 7.17\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{7.17}\n$$\n\nSo, Johnny's dad lost an **average of $7.17 per race** that day.", "decode_seconds": 7.8480750089511275, "draft_calls": 136, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 103, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "8fc64e2481ce5fccf0676d106dd43128bf8b7dfbdabda917cdfdf192c2ff6b87", "method": "relay_reduced", "output_hash": "585fea01c70e97d7b35c7012c2d7c5e3e23d453aaf1092aa1b3cfacc90cfb45a", "output_tokens": 436, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 19885451776, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20097007616, "problem_id": "gsm8k/b7f59158b17ad0c2", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 3203.2680937051773, "prefill_full_target": 32.832191467285156, "prefill_relay": 0.21104000508785248, "relay": 24.12668800354004, "unattributed_runtime": 137.20676658302546, "verification_full_target": 4450.430229187012}, "proposal_lengths": [7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 5, 7, 7, 3, 2, 2, 2, 2], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "3", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 7.8480750089511275, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20097007616, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20097007616, "target_calls": 136, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0, "turn_index": 0, "verify_count": 136}
